---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="ServiceMatch terms and conditions for householders and tradespeople.">
  <div class="container py-6 md:py-8 max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-h1 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using ServiceMatch, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">2. What ServiceMatch Does</h2>
      <p>ServiceMatch is a marketplace that connects householders in Northern Ireland with local tradespeople. We facilitate introductions but do not employ tradespeople or guarantee their work.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">3. User Accounts</h2>
      <p>You may register as a householder or tradesperson. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity under your account.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">4. Tradespeople</h2>
      <p>By listing on ServiceMatch, tradespeople confirm that:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>They hold relevant qualifications and certifications for their trade</li>
        <li>They have appropriate insurance coverage</li>
        <li>All information provided is accurate and up to date</li>
        <li>They will comply with all applicable laws and regulations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">5. Verification</h2>
      <p>We verify tradesperson credentials where possible. A "Verified" badge indicates we have confirmed stated qualifications. Verification does not constitute a guarantee of work quality.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">6. Service Agreements</h2>
      <p>Any agreement for services is between the householder and the tradesperson directly. ServiceMatch is not a party to such agreements and accepts no liability for work performed.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">7. Reviews and Ratings</h2>
      <p>Users may leave reviews based on genuine experiences. Reviews must be honest and not misleading. We reserve the right to remove reviews that violate this policy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">8. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
      <p>Users must not:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Provide false or misleading information</li>
        <li>Harass or abuse other users</li>
        <li>Use the platform for illegal purposes</li>
        <li>Attempt to circumvent verification processes</li>
        <li>Post spam, offensive content, or malware</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>ServiceMatch provides an introduction service only. We are not liable for:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Quality of work performed by tradespeople</li>
        <li>Any loss or damage arising from tradesperson services</li>
        <li>Availability or responsiveness of listed tradespeople</li>
        <li>Any disputes between householders and tradespeople</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">10. Termination</h2>
      <p>We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms. You may close your account at any time by contacting us.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">11. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of updated terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">12. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Northern Ireland. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Northern Ireland.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">13. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms, please contact us through our website.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>